# gazboard
===
 A free-form offline whiteboard for Windows, Linux, Android and macOS — pen, sticky notes, shapes, and Word / PowerPoint / PDF import you can write straight on top of. No account, no cloud. Hand a board to another computer on your own wifi if you want to; off by default.
